# The generated stub SOURCES (api/, public-api.h) and the generated build files
# (CMakeLists.txt, ondewo-client-config.cmake.in) are deliberately NOT ignored: C++ has no
# package registry, so a git tag is this client's only distribution channel and a consumer must
# get a buildable CMake project out of a plain `git clone` / FetchContent, without Docker.
# Only the BUILD OUTPUT above is ignored. Uncomment the two lines below to keep the generated
# sources out of the repository instead - consumers then need Docker and `make build`.
# api/
# public-api.h
